 "text": "1️⃣ The bullish EMA trend...\n\n13 EMA on top 🟡\n48 EMA in middle 🟣\n200 EMA on bottom 🔴\n\nHere's a simple cheat sheet to remember,\n\nAbove 200 EMA = Bullish\nAbove 200 + 48 EMA = More Bullish\nAbove 200 + 48 + 13 EMA = Mega Bullish\n\nVisual example of a bullish EMA trend 👇 https://t.co/GPYcCQqQUt",
